  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEA Water Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sea Water was founded in 2021. Sea Water sells a turn-key solution as a one-off investment for the production of high-quality packaged drinking water for the consumer market. There is an installation in IJmuiden, the Netherlands, for the production of this drinking water. Their product is for sale in Dutch supermarkets. Sea Water integrates the technology of Elemental Water Makers, a solar-powered desalination plant, and Hatenboer Water, a seawater after-treatment technology.Sea Water wants to demonstrate the complete turn-key solution in Morocco. Several potential customers have been found for this, namely a hosting party named World Wide Aqua, government parties, fast-moving consumer good (FMCG) companies, supermarkets and foreign parties.Demonstration is needed to show that the Sea Water solution can be technically applied in Moroccan conditions. This is because it deviates geologically and geographically from the Dutch conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
